{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04056","headline":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主第山门起灞川，宸游风景入初年。\n凤皇楼下交天仗，乌鹊桥头敞御筵。\n往往花间逢彩石，时时竹里见红泉。\n今朝扈跸平阳馆，不羡乘槎云汉边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}